customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Value.tooltip = Text value supplied to the selected action or custom event.
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Value.placeholder = e.g. true
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Amount = Amount
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Amount.tooltip = Whole-number amount supplied to actions such as incrementVariable. Defaults to 1.
