customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Subtitle.tooltip = Optional secondary text supplied to title actions.
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Subtitle.placeholder = e.g. Find the sealed gate
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Locked = Locked
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.mysticquests:action.Locked.tooltip = Optional boolean supplied to actions that lock or unlock a state.
